<title>USA: Dow drops more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow drops more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 50 points in late morning trading Wednesday after an early rally stalled just 10 points from the 8,000-point mark.</p>
<p>At 10:54 a.m. EDT, the Dow index was off 50.22 points at 7,912.09, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
